{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57179","headline":"大乘赞十首 九 · 宝志","name":"大乘赞十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"声闻心心断惑，能断之心是贼。\n贼贼递相除遣，何时了本语默。\n口内诵经千卷，体上问经不识。\n不解佛法圆通，徒劳寻行数黑。\n头陁阿练苦行，希望後身功德。\n希望即是隔圣，大道何由可得？\n譬如梦里度河，船师度过河北。\n忽觉牀上安眠，失却度船轨则。\n船师及彼度人，两个本不相识。\n衆生迷倒羇绊，往来三界疲极。\n觉悟生死如梦，一切求心自息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}